[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3813772302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115527#issuecomment-3813772302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115527","id":3813772302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jUYwO","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T20:26:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T20:26:21Z","body":"@zenorbi do you know if magic leap has support for activity-alias?\n\nWhich version of the vendors plugin are you testing with?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3813772302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3813792642","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115527#issuecomment-3813792642","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115527","id":3813792642,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jUduC","user":{"login":"zenorbi","id":313625,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzYyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/313625?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi","html_url":"https://github.com/zenorbi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T20:31:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T20:31:40Z","body":"Thank you for getting back so quickly!\n\nI was testing with Godot OpenXR Vendors v4 v4.3.0 throughout my git bisect.\n\nI was trying to find out if magic leap supports activity-alias or not, but couldn't find anything. Sadly I am really not an android developer, however if there is a simple test I could do to figure this out, I am willing to put in whatever is needed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3813792642/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3816452580","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115527#issuecomment-3816452580","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115527","id":3816452580,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jenHk","user":{"login":"zenorbi","id":313625,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzYyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/313625?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi","html_url":"https://github.com/zenorbi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zenorbi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T09:20:09Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T09:20:09Z","body":"@m4gr3d \n\nI did some testing. It looks like Magic Leap does not support the activity-alias tag. I commented out the `store_string_at_path` line in `EditorExportPlatformAndroid::_write_tmp_manifest` and converted the generated `AndroidManifest.xml` to an equivalent that does not use `<activity-alias>`. Because I don't really know how it works, I used AI to do the conversion.\n\n[AndroidManifest-ccf5be0dda03c59c303c8104288bb2c9a5a8236f.xml](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24932136/AndroidManifest-ccf5be0dda03c59c303c8104288bb2c9a5a8236f.xml)\n\n[AndroidManifest-4.6-stable.xml](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24932138/AndroidManifest-4.6-stable.xml)\n\nI did this test with both commit ccf5be0dda03c59c303c8104288bb2c9a5a8236f and 4.6-stable and both works now.\n\nHowever, Magic Leap just announced that they are \"discontinuing sales of Magic Leap 2 globally in March 2026\" ([Source](https://forum.magicleap.cloud/t/magic-leap-2-no-longer-for-sale-in-japan/6888/3)), so unless this is an issue with any other platform as well, I would just leave this behavior as-is and close this as won't fix. I can roll with a custom build of Godot.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3816452580/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3856541612","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115527#issuecomment-3856541612","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115527","id":3856541612,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7l3ies","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T22:06:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T22:06:05Z","body":"Thanks for the update @zenorbi!\n\n@BastiaanOlij @akien-mga Given the reasons for the introduction and use of `activity-alias`, I think we should proceed with dropping support for Magic Leap in Godot 4.6 and higher.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3856541612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]